[l_english.STATE_LORE_425]
Land of the Covenant, as the name suggests, is the place where archaeologists call the place where the Covenant of the Three Tribes took place thousands of years ago. The ancestors of the Earth Ponies, Pegasi, and Unicorns reached peace here, dispelled the Windigo, and established their homeland.
Today, under the control of the Changeling Empire, with the Windigo hovers over the top, the name “Land of the Covenant” has become a perfect silent indictment of the education of friendship and history in Equestria.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_425]
盟约之地，顾名思义，这里就是考古专家所称，数千年前三族盟约发生的地方。陆马、飞马与独角兽的祖先在这里达成了和平，驱散了风之魔，建立起了家园。
如今，这里在幻形灵帝国的管制下，风之魔在头顶盘旋。“盟约之地”这个名字，已经成为了对小马利亚友谊与历史教育完美的无声控诉。
